---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Burgas Nightlife & Eurovision 2027 Afterparties" 
  description="The ultimate guide to Burgas nightlife during Eurovision 2027. Discover the best clubs, beach bars, EuroClub locations, and VIP party access."
  breadcrumb="Nightlife"
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h1 class="text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">Burgas Nightlife & Eurovision 2027 Afterparties</h1>
      
      <p class="lead" style="font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 40px; color: var(--text-muted);">
        When the shows end, the real party begins. Burgas transforms into a massive coastal celebration during Eurovision. Here is your guide to the clubs, the beach bars, and securing VIP tables.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>The Official EuroClub & EuroVillage</h2>
        <p>The beating heart of Eurovision nightlife. The <strong>EuroVillage</strong> (free, public) will likely be located in the Sea Garden, offering daytime concerts and sponsor zones. The <strong>EuroClub</strong> (accreditation or OGAE required) is where delegations, press, and hardcore fans mingle.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> To be confirmed, but expect major venues near the Port of Burgas or Sea Station (Магазия 1).</li>
          <li><strong>Vibe:</strong> Non-stop Eurovision hits, drag performances, and live delegation acts.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4">
        <h2>The Beach Bars (Central Beach & North Beach)</h2>
        <p>Burgas has a unique nightlife culture centered right on the sand. During May, the weather warms up, and the beach bars along the central promenade open for the season.</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 16px;">
          <li><strong>Saxe Beach Club:</strong> Upscale, cocktails, deep house.</li>
          <li><strong>HashtagSTUDIO:</strong> Great for pre-drinks and a younger crowd.</li>
          <li><strong>Kite Bar:</strong> Laid-back, bohemian vibe, slightly further north.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px;"><em>Tip:</em> Dress codes are usually relaxed at beach bars, but smart-casual is recommended for late-night clubs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-magenta);">
        <h3>👑 VIP Table Booking & Private Yachts</h3>
        <p>Want to skip the queues? We have direct contacts with the top club managers in Burgas. Leave your email, and we will send you the secret links for private yacht parties and VIP table reservations before they sell out.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-top: 24px; text-align: center;">
          <a href="/concierge" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 16px 32px;">Request VIP Access via Concierge</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  
  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
